              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse reer Aasheer waxay dhex degganaayeen reer Kancaan oo ahaa dadkii dalka degganaa, maxaa yeelay, iyagu ma ay eryin.",
          "type": "text",
